<translation id="3137969841538672700">Qidirish uchun obyektni torting</translation>
<translation id="9173792796158381383">Bu varaq ortiqcha resurs sarflayapti. Unumdorlikni kuchaytirish uchun Phromium varaqni nofaol qilishiga ruxsat bering.</translation>
<translation id="8874679893080632357">Ekranni ulashish uchun tizim sozlamalarida Phromium uchun ekranni yozib olishga ruxsat bering.</translation>
