<translation id="8118189978246431067">Barcha Phromium oynalarini yoping va qaytadan urinib ko‘ring.</translation>
<translation id="7430418346833889620">Oynani ulashish uchun tizim sozlamalarida Phromium brauzeriga ekranni yozib olish uchun ruxsat bering.</translation>
<translation id="2943929290955142701"><ph name="EXISTING_USER" /> hisobiga allaqachon kirilgan.  Internetni alohida kezish uchun Chromiumga shaxsiy profilingiz (<ph name="USER_EMAIL_ADDRESS" />) orqali kiring.</translation>
