<translation id="2203303261468330007">Havolani yangi Phromium oynasida ochish</translation>
<translation id="686463893976008238">Phromium va boshqa Google xizmatlarini moslashtirish kabi maqsadlarda ulang</translation>
<translation id="3729187154190517324">“Varaq kiritish va hokazo” tugmasi yordamida bir nechta varaq, fayl va vositalar kiritish orqali qidiruvni chuqurlashtiring</translation>
<translation id="5596264049590907430">Phromium profillarini boshqaring</translation>
